      "message": "Rule out two shortcuts for the one-word window\n\nDropping the tableau word's own mask test fails (stray bits move to untested\npositions under the convolution shifts); zero-padding to avoid the\nreduction modulo q-1 fails (the temporal stride is read from R modulo dN\nand every linear layout leaves one neighbour offset unbounded).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
