      "message": "Pin down the one-word window target: self-certifying tableau words\n\nThree facts added to the brief: the test word must be the residue reduced\nmodulo q-1 (the rotation 2^(R-dN) is astronomically large), J must stay an\ninteger register because it multiplies the masks, and population\nsaturation is the only bit test, so every present-type window needs the\nthree source unknowns J, C and F or t. A one-word window therefore has to\nmake the tableau word self-certifying.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
