        "date": "2026-10-24T22:39:55Z"
      },
      "message": "Inventory and triage eight new Diophantine consistency proposals\n\nRecord every archive and member hash for45b399ec51: eight ZIPs,\n1693 members and14755359 archive bytes. Statically index all237 Python\nmembers and60 README occurrences without importing or executing incoming\nprograms. Preserve exact full-read scopes for the overviews and selected\nordinary proofs; separate provisional mathematical assessments from\nwhole-packet or frontier acceptance.\n\nPrioritize the claimed92/283 saturated ten-positive equation,96/266\ncoprime fusion and517/519-integer direct quartics for full ordinary,\nsource, code and artifact review. Record reusable anchored-sum,\nexisting-b-majorant, even-index and quotient-frame mechanisms together\nwith their exact calibration and chronology obligations.\n\nRoot independently authenticates all member bytes and replays the entire\nstatic AST index. No incoming PASS receipt establishes a new endpoint;\nkeep the current98/360 page and accepted comparison frontier unchanged\nuntil full verification. Lean remains paused and research continues.",
